flowchart BT
  accTitle: Bounded contexts and the dependency direction
  accDescr: shared is the base; ingestion depends on it, catalog on ingestion, entity_resolution and pricing on catalog, enrichment on both, discovery on enrichment, and entrypoints on everything. import-linter enforces this direction.
  shared["shared<br/>shared kernel: money, dates, provenance, LLM ports"]
  ingestion["ingestion<br/>crawling, snapshots, parsers"]
  catalog["catalog<br/>listings, calendar, reviews, photos"]
  er["entity_resolution<br/>pairs, evidence, judge, villas"]
  pricing["pricing<br/>all-in price, offers"]
  enrichment["enrichment<br/>geo, claims, truth check, summaries"]
  discovery["discovery<br/>query understanding, ranking, explanation"]
  entry["entrypoints<br/>CLI, API, composition root"]:::decision
  ingestion --> shared
  catalog --> ingestion
  er --> catalog
  pricing --> catalog
  enrichment --> er
  enrichment --> pricing
  discovery --> enrichment
  entry --> discovery
